From: Pablo Lopez <plopez@unc.edu.ar>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 19:54:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Portable build: conda environment, auto-configured Makefile,
 fixes for recent CGAL/Boost/HDF5

- Add environment.yml with compiler and all dependencies (conda-forge)
- Makefile: take library paths from the active conda env (LIB_PREFIX),
  auto-detect HDF5 C++ (USE_HDF5=auto|yes|no), embed rpath, drop -lCGAL
  (CGAL>=5 is header-only) and unused boost_thread/boost_system
- Replace deprecated boost::timer (removed in recent Boost) with CPU_timer
- HDF5 2.x: drop ambiguous H5P_DEFAULT argument in H5File constructors
- density_file_io.cc: guard HDF5-only call so the code builds without HDF5
- README: compilation instructions

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01C44ZCErHKsQgk681XW3FMn
